1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,033
Day twenty-seven. The sky is perfect.
And every frigate bird on the island
turns, and flies inland.

2
00:00:06,533 --> 00:00:09,267
Rule eighteen. When the birds go
inland, so do you.

3
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:16,267
A cyclone is coming. The raft is on
the beach. The radio is in the hut.
You can carry one uphill. Raft or
radio?

4
00:00:16,767 --> 00:00:20,600
The radio. Without the signal, nobody
knows where to look.
